    {
      "id": "claim_291fae00d3084e778a2039c397eb33b6",
      "statement": "The service holds the master key and stored keys out of the HTTP request path: clients authenticate with their own http_client.* derived key and the service applies stored keys by alias, so keys are never transmitted over the wire.",
